              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Heelesinjia so nende mawo oluyali, shinga OMWAMI Nyasayewo olwa yakhulaka; tsindaa-lotsio mana tsibe tsinyinji, nawe okaase, mushialo eshia OMWAMI Nyasayewo yakhuheele.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.5.16",
