        {
          "text": "Kata orakhaayilwa omukhasi wowashio ta; kata oreekomba inzu yowashio, kata omukundalkwe, kata omukholiwe oweshisaatsa kata omukholiwe oweshikilasi, ing'ombeye kata isishiliye, kata eshindu shiosi eshia owashio ali ninashio tawe.",
          "type": "text",
