          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amakhuwa ako OMWAMI yaboolela libukaana lieenywe liosi mushikulu okhurula murmulilo hakari, nomwileesi, nomulucheka, nende omwoyo omukhongo; ne narameeta akand ta. Ne yakahandiika khurubaho rubili rwamachina, narumbeelesia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.5.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.5.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 5:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana olwa mwahulila omwoyo okwo nikurula mushiilima hakari, olwa eshikulu shiali nishiyiitsanga omulilo, mwasita khwo ahambi, abeemilisi bosi betsimbia tsieenywe, nabakofu beenywe; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.5.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.5.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 5:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nimusunga mbu Lola, OMWAMI Nyasaye weefwe akhumanyiye oluyalilwe nobukhongobwe, neefu khuhuliile omwoyokwe okhurula mumulilo hakari. Leelo khuluutsi mbu OMWAMI asungananga nomundu, naye nabaho mwoyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.5.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.5.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 5:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kho bulaano nishiina eshiakhachila khwafwa? Okhuba omulilo kuno omukhongo kulakhusamba; nikhuba nikhuhulila omwoyo kwOMWAMI Nyasaye weefwe khandi, khulafwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.5.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.5.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 5:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Okhuba ali heena, khubandu bosi, owahulilakhwo omwoyo kwaNyasaye oubeetsangaho mwoyo, naboolanga mumulilo hakari, shinga ifwe olwa khuhuliile, nabaho mwoyo? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.5.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.5.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 5:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iwe osite ahambi, ohulile kosi aka OMWAMI Nyasaye weefwe alakhuboolela; neefu khulakahulila, nikhukakhola.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.5.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.5.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 5:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.5.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.5.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 5:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne OMWAMI yahulila amakhuwa aka mwa-boola, okva mwasungana ninasi; OMWAMI niyasunjila ari Embuliile amakhuwa aka abandu bano baboolile, aka bakhusunjiile iwe; bateechile, mukosi aka basunjile. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.5.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.5.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 5:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Shiakhuha baba nomwoyo okufwana kurio tsindaalo tsiosi, okhuriitsanga nokhulinda amalako kanje kosi, mbu bakaasenje, nende abaana babwe, obushia nobushia! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.5.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.5.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 5:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tsia obaboolele mbu Kalushe mumaheema keenywe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.5.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.5.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 5:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nebutswa iwe, sinjila hano ninasi, mana ndalakhuboolela amalako kosi, nakalachilisibwa, nobukhalachi, akeene aka olabeechesia, mbu bakakholenje mushialo eshia emuheelesia shibe eshieenywe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.5.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.5.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 5:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kho mwitsulilenje okhu-khola shinga OMWAMI Nyasaye weenywe olwa yaznulaka; mureebera khumukhono musaatsa kata omukhasi ta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.5.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.5.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 5:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muekendenje khunjila yosi eya OMWAMI Nyasaye weenywe yamulaka, mbu mube mwoyo, khandi mbu mukaase, tsindaalo tsieenywe nitsimeetekha mushialo eshiliba eshieenywe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.5.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.5.33"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
